    <a href="#characters">Characters</a> |
    <a href="#notes">Reader Notes</a>
</nav>

<hr>

<main>

<article id="chapter">

    <h2>Chapter 1: A New Beginning</h2>

    <p>
        The morning began quietly. A new day brought
        new possibilities and unexpected discoveries.
    </p>

    <p>
        The journey ahead was unknown, but curiosity
        made every step exciting.
    </p>

    <p>
        Sometimes the smallest decision can become
        the beginning of a much larger adventure.
    </p>

</article>

<hr>

<section id="characters">

    <h2>👥 Characters</h2>

    <dl>

        <dt><strong>Maya</strong></dt>
        <dd>A curious student who loves discovering new things.</dd>

        <dt><strong>Leo</strong></dt>
        <dd>A creative friend who enjoys solving problems.</dd>

        <dt><strong>The Mentor</strong></dt>
        <dd>A mysterious guide who shares valuable advice.</dd>

    </dl>

</section>

<hr>

<section id="notes">

    <h2>📝 Reader Notes</h2>

    <textarea
        rows="8"
        cols="60"
        placeholder="Write your thoughts about this chapter..."></textarea>

</section>

</main>

<footer>
    <hr>
    <p>Digital Book Reader — HTML Project</p>
</footer>

